{"id":"W8ab3ff1c6fbc68d3568c8288","zh":"平均风","en":"","name":"平均风","language":"zh","domain":"车辆轨道随机动力学","concept_id":"C313e7e1888b3751ca457","families":[],"definition_zh":"风速分解中随时间平均的风分量。","definition_en":null,"scope_note":null,"usage_note":null,"usage_overview":"平均风在风速分解中作为准静态分量，用于计算横风作用下车辆—轨道系统所受的静风力。","translation_note":null,"usage_variants":[],"designations":[{"id":"W8ab3ff1c6fbc68d3568c8288","text":"平均风","language":"zh","role":"headword"}],"complete_examples":[{"id":"Se1b45591b4004245c84e","source_id":"P111","page":1,"page_end":1,"language":"zh","text":"大量实测资料表明 [6],风速由准静态平均风和随机脉动风构成,通过对车辆系统产生风压,进而影响车辆/轨道系统的综合动力性能。","citations":[{"source_id":"P111","page":1,"page_end":1}]},{"id":"Sf42d8f2de69c898c865a","source_id":"P111","page":1,"page_end":1,"language":"zh","text":"其中,横风由平均风和随机脉动风构成,考虑脉动风的空间相关性,采用谐波合成法模拟脉动风速,用Karhunen-Loève展开法把握脉动风的随机特征;采用轨道不平顺概率模型,生成轨道随机不平顺样本序列;通过将横风和轨道不平顺转化为相应的车辆- 轨道系统荷载矢量,从而建立用于风-轨道不平顺联合分析的车辆-轨道随机分析模型。","citations":[{"source_id":"P111","page":1,"page_end":1}]}],"sources":{"P111":{"id":"P111","title":"横风和轨道不平顺联合作用下的车辆-轨道系统随机分析模型","authors":"徐磊,翟婉明","year":"2018","doi":"10.16385/j.cnki.issn.1004-4523.2018.01.005","journal_citation":"振动工程学报","label":"徐磊等（2018）","overview_slug":"2018-the-vehicle-track-stochastic-model-considering-joint-effects-of-cross-winds-and-track-random-irregul"}},"relations":[],"related_terms":[],"collocations":[],"symbols":[],"units":[],"formulas":[],"external_references":[],"suggested_comparisons":[],"contexts":[{"text":"风速中的准静态成分，用于计算静风力。","language":"zh","source_id":"P111","paper_slug":"2018-the-vehicle-track-stochastic-model-considering-joint-effects-of-cross-winds-and-track-random-irregul","title":"横风和轨道不平顺联合作用下的车辆-轨道系统随机分析模型","kind":"paper_usage"}],"word_links":[{"id":"W24525ad33f1aedca08479b4c","name":"average wind","language":"en","kind":"translation","label":"对应表达","reason":null}],"expression_links":[{"id":"W24525ad33f1aedca08479b4c","name":"average wind","language":"en","kind":"translation","label":"对应表达","reaso